.cache/

memory/test_credentials.md

# Mobile development
android-sdk/

# Native projects generated by `expo prebuild` / `expo run:*`. The APK workflow
# regenerates frontend/android on every run, so only its build scratch (.gradle
# caches, debug keystore) ever lands here.
/frontend/android/
/frontend/ios/
.env
.env.*
*.env
credentials.json
*.key
.credentials

# Repo hygiene — agent scratch, generated logs, archived backend, media dumps
